0 // Source: C:\Users\arron\Downloads\pdf预览\3+蝴蝶搭建说明_pdf, pages 1-12.
0 // Grid: 40 LDU per DUPLO stud; 48 LDU per full-height brick.
0 // Axes: X left/right; +Y down; +Z rear and -Z front.
0 // Origin: center of the bottom row at its top connection plane; the model is two studs deep.
0 // Parts: official 3011.dat 2x4 brick, 3437.dat 2x2 brick, and 3437pe1.dat eye brick.
0 // Source discrepancy: pages 1-10 add five blue 2x2 bricks and six yellow 2x4 bricks,
0 // while the page-11 BOM groups those counts as nine yellow 2x2 bricks, six blue 2x4 bricks,
0 // and four yellow 2x4 bricks. Placement colors follow the consecutive build pages.
0 // Page 11 is the parts summary and page 12 is the completed-model view; neither adds parts.
0 // Verification: renderer-verified only; collision/static and multi-view step renders passed.
0 // Not opened in BrickLink Studio.

